# Hidden under niri: comes with the Cinnamon fallback session
[Desktop Entry]
NotShowIn=niri;
Name=Book Reader
Comment=Read EPUB books
Exec=xepub %U
Icon=xepub
Terminal=false
Type=Application
Categories=Office;Viewer;
MimeType=application/epub+zip;
Keywords=ebook;book;reader;EPUB;
StartupWMClass=org.x.Xepub
StartupNotify=true
